"try rebuilding the index file. This will take some time to rebuild, but will "
"not cause any problems.</p>"
"<p>If that is not enough, you can try refreshing the IMAP cache. If you do "
"this, you will loose all your local changes for this folder and all it's "
"subfolders.</p>"
